How the matching image for Japanese Diamond and Pearl is built: the pristine US
build, with the game's own C code compiled by Metrowerks 1.2/sp4 as Japanese
was. The libraries, assembly and link keep their US tools. The symbol map then
finds the C functions by their bytes, as it does for every other language.

Metrowerks 1.2 has no -ipa or __declspec, is stricter about pointer types and
returning a void call, and warns where 2.0 does not; none of these changes code.

diff --git a/arm9/Makefile b/arm9/Makefile
index d706c1a7..67d8aec0 100644
--- a/arm9/Makefile
